{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "b74d8841aec8b03cb1112fc497d2c95454fe9326b741a07b78908d6efbc47811", "ja": "うれしいです。期待に応えられるよう、\nがんばります。……にこっ。", "zh": "我很开心。为了不辜负您的期待，\n我会努力的。……微笑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "660353c1e1ff2cbe786938b139f09726361cde17c0cae09caaf8a52fe1704a32", "ja": "それでは、次の方、どうぞ。", "zh": "那么，下一位，请进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1005_danseinofun", "source_sha256": "7e28960d463e4c02eba9041c3ac1914c5857249a5da2d0a842045f36d5041e22", "ja": "あ、あの……俺、この間、初めて公演を見に行って。\nそれで、瑞希さんのファンになりました！", "zh": "啊，那个……我前阵子第一次去看了公演。\n然后，就成了瑞希小姐的粉丝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "23d2a1b48dce56acb9ce0f359a5e8467125476eb31a2e9ec0c0e239760fae7af", "ja": "本当ですか。……やったぞ、瑞希。\nこれからも、応援よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "真的吗。……成功了，瑞希。\n今后也请继续支持我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1007_danseinofun", "source_sha256": "560bd571680457ddb4d0cd45e6bb0d2eda1392786a68c8295b9a4f2798763fdc", "ja": "もちろんです！　えっと、その……\n笑顔、すっごくカワイイですね！", "zh": "那是当然了！那个，就是……\n你的笑容，超级可爱呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "c797b40dc3df79635cf0ba034c5f9ec6961d78d2f796aa910bd94f9ece2e0f16", "ja": "かわいい。……ぽっ。\nありがとうございます。とてもうれしいです。", "zh": "好可爱。……噗。\n谢谢您。我非常开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "6c1469f47f2e6ab525688c8a0e456bdcd67ee8acce8b4b13b70bfa6dcbfe5aff", "ja": "いつか、クールでかっこいい私も\n見てください。……キリッ。", "zh": "希望有朝一日，您也能看看\n帅气又酷炫的我。……眼神一凛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1010_danseinofun", "source_sha256": "4ace8ad99bf3babdc4ab569ba38f33a7c10aab5fc709424b733697b3272f7781", "ja": "はい！　楽しみにしてます！", "zh": "好的！我很期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0f539fba7f0f9381c994906f57c77541538db04c891c881e02dceef3ee5e57a3", "ja": "瑞希、お疲れ様！\n今日のお渡し会は、笑顔が多かったな。", "zh": "瑞希，辛苦了！\n今天的递交会，大家脸上的笑容真多啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "642573ab7b09e17bd7d72c078c19465e0aacaf6ca0784ac2fc3078bb9d2980c8", "ja": "はい。ファンのみなさんとの会話で、\n自然と笑顔になれた気がします。", "zh": "是的。和粉丝们聊天时，感觉自然而然就露出了笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "3bc5ff6a6cba63eb32f06321c3de35366715cd01938bdc9d02241bf5c854a269", "ja": "それと……やっと、言葉にできそうです。\n自分が、クールにこだわっていたわけを。", "zh": "还有……我好像终于能把它说出来了。\n我为何一直执着于保持冷酷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1015_p", "source_sha256": "774d79fae324439ec2570717f9cdcdf8c5479b93d0a4af57a1992b52479592c4", "ja": "え？　そうなのか？", "zh": "咦？是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "4eefb588f605937ec6f9fd4a1bb4511060f71bf5e72a4fc7191062fd52c8d743", "ja": "はい。……笑顔のあまり上手ではない私を、\n{$P$}は、良いと言ってくれました。", "zh": "是的……{$P$}说，不太擅长露出笑容的我，也很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "1a5fd2f90e65e61fe2cc2b0d98217d36d20e440751d5f74fa5bcfdcd7447825f", "ja": "それも、私の個性で魅力だと教えてくれて。\n……私を、アイドルにしてくれました。", "zh": "而且，您还告诉我，那也是我的个性与魅力。\n……是您让我成为了偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "65381c8ad17a0a2c92292c9a347a470fd4a794f46eb7e84c3f579388046ca593", "ja": "{$P$}が良いと言ってくれた武器。\n私は、それをなくすのが、怖かったのかもしれません。", "zh": "{$P$}说很不错的武器。\n也许，我是害怕失去它吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3177edafd8bf4320f32f00f9cb07f2f5790ee1ffb398d7d0b288f5505df8b1d9", "ja": "そうか。……今はどうだ？", "zh": "是吗……那现在呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "360044164bda66b2006c530f2ef89a87d2dede5fb55223fba510304d76c88c6c", "ja": "{$P$}が、私の最初のファン。\nならきっと、他のみなさんも大丈夫。", "zh": "{$P$}是我的第一位粉丝。\n那么，其他各位肯定也没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "3056467431e92e0fc48e20e77f52cf4e4679dd72a81af6d0e79152a1214b79b9", "ja": "私は、{$P$}が褒めてくれた\n私の魅力を、信じます。……ぐっ。", "zh": "我相信{$P$}夸奖过的、属于我的魅力。……嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b2e99c2c4a7e84f20069244c4a5efcdd1f41b62123a302f415369e8ae7a65dc5", "ja": "ああ。信じてくれ！", "zh": "啊。请相信我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "671df88bd5c8fe273ddb92458a6eaac1038de1a8af631809ab9fb35cd863538b", "ja": "なので、笑顔が素敵なアイドルになりたい、\nという気持ちはあるのですが……。", "zh": "所以，我确实有想成为笑容灿烂的偶像的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "c9b3b4f199770a95741b9c7db32c961262debc6239f87e0a4396e81bec02038f", "ja": "それでいて、クール系美少女。\nそんなアイドルを目指そうと思います。……折衷案。", "zh": "同时还是一位冷酷系美少女。\n我想以这样的偶像为目标……算是折中方案吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1025_p", "source_sha256": "7483cad08dfd77183278f855596ee5ca00c8001e16731b6ec8ee11d200485a3c", "ja": "笑顔が素敵で、クールなアイドルか。\n欲張りだな！", "zh": "笑容灿烂又很酷的偶像啊。真贪心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_112_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "c3f7b3ace44369b3e5f21480bb64c27fbea3554ea45e9f36976f7dfe4886ddfb", "ja": "はい。\nですが、驚かせるのは得意ですから。", "zh": "是的。\n不过，吓人可是我的拿手好戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
